  "description": "Provides a statistical overview of the land surface temperature over each 10-day compositing period and every geostationary sensor image pixel, including a Thermal Condition Index. The minimum, median and maximum LST are calculated regardless of any specific hour of the day. The data are available at global scale in the spatial resolution of about 3 km and cover the period from January 2018 to the present.",
